<h1>Sample 37 of 40</h1>
<p>This page is the object <b>sample37</b>. It lives in the drawer <b>samples</b> of the storage room.</p>
<p class="chip">It was not in memory at boot: the kernel read it from the disk the first time it was used.</p>
<p>The main cabinet holds 62 entries; every drawer holds 63 more.</p>
